<title>UK: Norway's Statfjord Oct loadings up 3 at 31 cargoes.</title>
<headline>Norway's Statfjord Oct loadings up 3 at 31 cargoes.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Statfjord crude system is expected to load 31 cargoes in October, three more than in September, trading sources said on Friday.  </p>
<p>The schedule begins with a cargo loading in the range September 30 to October 2 and ends with one loading between October 30 and November 1.</p>
<p>Statfjord crude is loaded offshore in 855,000-barrel shipments.</p>
<p>-- Mark Thompson, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7930</p>
</text>
